            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Allrecipes Member"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I threw everything except the agave and mint in the juicer, then added them to the juice and poured into Popsicle molds for morning \"juice bars\". Great way to reduce juice intake and make sure you savor the flavor. Can't wait for the kids to try tomorrow. A.M. update : My toddler and teen devoured these!",
